      "text": "{\"verdicts\":[{\"n\":1,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/utils.py:861-866\"],\"reason\":\"should_bypass_proxies wraps the proxy_bypass(hostname) call in `with set_environ(\\\"no_proxy\\\", no_proxy_arg)`.\"},{\"n\":2,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:967-977\",\"src/requests/models.py:935-956\"],\"reason\":\"When `_content_consumed` is False, `chunks = generate()` creates the generator which is returned un-iterated (unless decode_unicode wraps it).\"},{\"n\":3,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/structures.py:42-45\"],\"reason\":\"The docstring states that keys with equal `.lower()`s given to the constructor, update, or equality comparison produce undefined behavior.\"},{\"n\":4,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:440-446\",\"src/requests/sessions.py:536-538\",\"src/requests/auth.py:111-113\"],\"reason\":\"prepare_headers runs before prepare_auth, and the netrc-derived HTTPBasicAuth overwrites headers[\\\"Authorization\\\"] last.\"},{\"n\":5,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/sessions.py:540-542\"],\"reason\":\"Line 542 inside prepare_request passes `method=method.upper()` to p.prepare().\"},{\"n\":6,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/adapters.py:555-563\"],\"reason\":\"close() calls self.poolmanager.clear() and clears each proxy manager, as documented in its docstring.\"},{\"n\":7,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/sessions.py:480-482\"],\"reason\":\"Session.__init__ assigns self.cert = None.\"},{\"n\":8,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/cookies.py:60-78\"],\"reason\":\"get_full_url returns the plain URL only when no Host header is set; otherwise it rebuilds the URL using the Host header value.\"},{\"n\":9,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/sessions.py:530-533\",\"src/requests/cookies.py:604-623\",\"src/requests/cookies.py:391-399\"],\"reason\":\"The session jar is only used as the source argument to merge_cookies into a fresh RequestsCookieJar, which copies cookies rather than mutating the session jar.\"},{\"n\":10,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/adapters.py:696-708\"],\"reason\":\"conn.urlopen is invoked with exactly those keyword arguments including redirect=False, preload_content=False, decode_content=False, retries=self.max_retries, timeout=resolved_timeout and chunked=chunked.\"},{\"n\":11,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/sessions.py:142-152\"],\"reason\":\"get_redirect_target branches on `if resp.is_redirect:` before returning the location.\"},{\"n\":12,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:444-451\"],\"reason\":\"The comments state prepare_auth must be last and that prepare_hooks must go after it because authenticators could add a hook.\"},{\"n\":13,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:691-697\"],\"reason\":\"After calling auth_handler, the code updates __dict__ from the returned request and then calls prepare_content_length(self.body).\"},{\"n\":14,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/auth.py:111-113\"],\"reason\":\"__call__ sets r.headers[\\\"Authorization\\\"] on the passed request and returns r itself.\"},{\"n\":15,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/sessions.py:186-197\"],\"reason\":\"resolve_redirects declares `yield_requests: bool = False`.\"},{\"n\":16,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/structures.py:20-20\",\"src/requests/structures.py:64-74\"],\"reason\":\"CaseInsensitiveDict subclasses MutableMapping and defines only __iter__/__getitem__ etc., not items(), so items() comes from the ABC mixin.\"},{\"n\":17,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:876-881\"],\"reason\":\"is_redirect returns `\\\"location\\\" in self.headers and self.status_code in REDIRECT_STATI`.\"},{\"n\":18,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:407-422\",\"src/requests/hooks.py:22-26\"],\"reason\":\"__init__ sets those attributes to None and hooks to default_hooks(), which is {'response': []}.\"},{\"n\":19,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/models.py:505-507\"],\"reason\":\"prepare_url returns early setting self.url = url for non-http schemes containing ':'.\"},{\"n\":20,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/requests/auth.py:68-69\",\"src/requests/models.py:682-691\"],\"reason\":\"_basic_auth_str encodes a str password with latin1, which raises UnicodeEncodeError for characters outside latin-1, and it is invoked from prepare_auth.\"}]}",
